From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Calcite <calcite@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gpui): alpha-shaped drop shadow content filter

Adds Filter::DropShadow. A content filter layer draws a blurred, offset, tinted copy of its own alpha, then the sharp layer over it. Metal, wgpu, and Direct3D share the composite shader and the blur passes of the glass patch; each backend adds one composite pass for the sharp copy. BlurUniforms grows by 32 bytes.

